---
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import { fetchGithubStars, formatStarCount } from "../github";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { CORTEXAI_CONTACT_URL } from "../site";

const stars = await fetchGithubStars();
const starsLabel = stars === null ? "Star" : formatStarCount(stars);
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy · CortexAI Agent Hub"
  description="How privacy responsibilities work for CortexAI Agent Hub deployments."
>
  <div class="container">
    <Header starsLabel={starsLabel} />
    <main id="main" class="privacy-copy">
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p><strong>Last updated: September 3, 2026</strong></p>
      <p>
        CortexAI Agent Hub is self-hostable software. The organization operating a deployment controls the
        information sent to it and is responsible for its privacy practices. This page describes the data the
        software may process; it is not a substitute for the deployment operator's privacy notice.
      </p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>Depending on how you use CortexAI Agent Hub, we collect:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Contact and account information, such as your name, email address, and authentication records.</li>
        <li>
          Content you provide to the service, including assistant instructions, messages, tasks, memories, files,
          routines, and support communications.
        </li>
        <li>
          Connection information you choose to provide, such as encrypted credentials or tokens for model
          providers, connected applications, and browser sessions.
        </li>
        <li>
          Technical information needed to operate and secure the service, such as IP address, user agent,
          session records, device push token, timestamps, and diagnostic information.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How we use information</h2>
      <p>We use this information to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Provide, maintain, secure, and troubleshoot CortexAI Agent Hub.</li>
        <li>Authenticate you and synchronize your account across supported clients.</li>
        <li>Run the assistants, routines, connections, and notifications you request.</li>
        <li>Respond to support requests and comply with legal obligations.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Service providers and AI processing</h2>
      <p>
        CortexAI Agent Hub sends information to services only as needed to perform the work you request. Depending on the
        deployment and integrations you select, those services may host infrastructure, run sandboxes,
        deliver push notifications, connect third-party apps, store data, or process prompts with an AI model.
        Information sent to a model or connected app is also governed by that provider’s terms and privacy
        policy. We do not sell personal information or use CortexAI Agent Hub content for third-party advertising.
      </p>

      <h2>Self-hosted deployments</h2>
      <p>
        The CortexAI Agent Hub mobile app can connect to a server that you or another organization operates. In that case,
        the server operator controls the information sent to that deployment. The app stores the
        selected server address and session token securely on your device.
      </p>

      <h2>Retention and deletion</h2>
      <p>
        We keep hosted account information and content while your account is active and as reasonably needed to
        provide the service. You can permanently delete your hosted account and associated personal Space
        data from the Account screen in the CortexAI Agent Hub app. We may retain limited information when required by law,
        to resolve disputes, or to enforce agreements. Information already sent to a third-party provider is
        subject to that provider’s retention practices.
      </p>

      <h2>Security and international transfers</h2>
      <p>
        We use reasonable technical and organizational safeguards designed to protect personal information. No
        system is completely secure. We and our service providers may process information in the United States
        and other countries, which may have different data-protection laws than your country.
      </p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>
        CortexAI Agent Hub is not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from
        children under 13.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Depending on where you live, you may have rights to access, correct, delete, restrict, or receive a copy
        of your personal information, or to object to certain processing. Contact us to make a request.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>
        For CortexAI product and privacy inquiries, <a href={CORTEXAI_CONTACT_URL}>contact CortexAI</a>.
      </p>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
